invariant: INV-45
file: sha3.c
catches: sha3_equiv_test
reason: lane_from_bytes puts a message's second and third bytes in each
  other's place, which is what a careless move to eight bytes at a
  time does. A digest of any message of eight bytes or more differs
  from the reference's.

--- old
    return (uint64_t)b[0] | ((uint64_t)b[1] << 8) | ((uint64_t)b[2] << 16) |
--- new
    return (uint64_t)b[0] | ((uint64_t)b[1] << 16) | ((uint64_t)b[2] << 8) |
